repository-code: 'https://github.com/RicardoJCMarques/SSH.RP'
abstract: >-
  An embedded SSHv2 server firmware for RP2040 boards with WIZnet W5500 Ethernet connectivity (W55RP20 and discrete W5500 modules), built with wolfSSH and wolfCrypt using Ed25519 public-key authentication and Curve25519 key exchange.
keywords:
  - SSH
  - RP2040
  - Raspberry-Pi-Pico
  - W5500
  - W55RP20
  - wolfSSH
  - wolfSSL
  - Ethernet
  - Ed25519
  - Embedded
